+focus, close, pin, unpin or back to existing views in connected apps. The
+server validates the request and installed plugin before delivering an
+owner-scoped signal. The host validates its payload and uses the current
+owner callbacks. Closing a pinned view is ignored until it is unpinned;
+unsupported optional actions and absent views are ignored. `delivered` counts
+connected app clients, not successful actions. Commands are transient and
+never replayed after reconnect. Stabilization requires testing multiple
+windows, unload races, malformed signals and state retention through remote
